name nimsticks
category Package
revision 64118
shortdesc Draws sticks for games of multi-pile Nim
longdesc This LaTeX package provides commands \drawnimstick to draw a
longdesc single nim stick and \nimgame which represents games of
longdesc multi-pile Nim. Nim sticks are drawn with a little random
longdesc wobble so they look 'thrown together' and not too regular. The
longdesc package also provides options to customise the size and colour
longdesc of the sticks, and flexibility to draw heaps of different
longdesc objects.
